WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:05.148
A little curiosity. A whole sky of possibilities. Meet Star Gazer.

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:11.090
Pick your avatar, tell us a little about yourself, and start dreaming.

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:16.497
Choose an evening, or make it a weekly habit. Leave time for the

00:00:16.497 --> 00:00:17.298
journey home.

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:22.149
While you plan, discover nights you could join. This one has a

00:00:22.149 --> 00:00:24.355
telescope, and someone happy to teach.

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:29.224
Before you say yes, check the sky, the weather, and who you will be

00:00:29.224 --> 00:00:30.101
sharing it with.

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:35.822
Make your own way, or choose a public pickup. Review the times, then

00:00:35.822 --> 00:00:36.136
join.

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:42.162
Choose email or Google Calendar for invitations. You can always

00:00:42.162 --> 00:00:43.925
respond on the outing page.

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:49.139
You are in. One page keeps the people, the plan, and your journey

00:00:49.139 --> 00:00:49.706
together.

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:54.660
Found your kind of people? Invite them into your circle for another

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:55.845
night under the stars.

00:00:57.050 --> 00:01:01.798
Or create your own evening. Invite your circle, and leave room for new

00:01:01.798 --> 00:01:02.205
faces.

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:07.184
Less planning. More wonder. Star Gazer. Look up, together.
